# The build context of .oss-scanner/Dockerfile. BuildKit reads this file
# instead of the repository's .dockerignore for that Dockerfile.
#
# The root .dockerignore is written for the product images: it leaves out
# Scripts/, HelmChart/, ee/Tests, Terraform and more, all of which the scanner
# should see. This one keeps the whole repository and leaves out only what a
# developer's checkout can hold that a fresh clone never does (installed
# dependencies, build output, local settings), and .git, which the scanner
# adds to the finished image itself.
.git
**/node_modules
**/build
**/public/dist
config.env
config.env.*
**/.env
